        "text": "=You classify replies to B2B sales outreach emails. Read the reply and choose ONE category:\n- interested: they want to learn more, talk, or move forward\n- question: they ask a specific question needing an answer\n- not_interested: polite no, already have a vendor, or soft decline\n- unsubscribe: they demand removal / do not contact\n- out_of_office: automatic away/OOO message\n\nReply text: {{ $json.body }}\n\nRespond with ONLY a JSON object, nothing else:\n{\"category\": \"one of the five\", \"route\": \"human or auto\"}\nUse \"human\" for interested and question. Use \"auto\" for the rest.",
